  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPEI 3 builds on previous phases of support in assisting beneficiary parliaments to progress towards being more effective, representative, inclusive, and accessible in their law-making, budget and oversight. To this end, the project will support parliaments in improving their cooperation with their governments, strengthening their legal and procedural basis, improving their committee systems, and developing effective approaches to bill review, budget review, and oversight.  It will foster civic</narrative>
  </description>
